      },
      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/418-thread-repeat-pass-v2 (create.rs, edit.rs, gates.rs, inverted_post.rs: keep both sides)\n\n- commands/operation/{create,edit,gates}.rs: main's #894 thread-mill\n  `thread_gate`, #546 `named_refusal`, and the sinker/tool_door/wire\n  gates all stay; this branch's lathe infeed-plan gate (#416) is renamed\n  `infeed_plan_gate` so it no longer collides with main's `thread_gate`,\n  exactly as #516's refresh (4d806580) resolved it - the three files are\n  taken from that resolution. No refusal from either side is dropped.\n- tests/inverted_post.rs moved to crates/post/tests on main (camcraft_post\n  paths); this branch's two ThreadRec fields (alternating,\n  repeat_each_depth) are kept in the moved file.\n\nPicks up main's #1352 (0ad525d8) fix for #1351.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
