      "message": "test: add this stack's new thread fields at main's new literals\n\nMain's merge brought Threading and ThreadCycle literals written after this\nbranch's base: `infeed_plan: Default::default()` in coarse_laws.rs,\nlathe_post_css.rs and tormach_lathe_support/mod.rs (the same lines #516's\nbranch carries), and `alternating: false, repeat_each_depth: false` in\ncrates/post/tests/recorded_streams.rs. Defaults only - no test's intent\nchanges.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
