        "date": "2026-11-13T06:10:36Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge issue/417-g76-matches-verified-v2 (refreshed, 31946250) into issue/418-thread-repeat-pass-v2 (inverted_post.rs, recorded_streams.rs: keep both fields)\n\nThis branch is stacked on #417 but carried an older #417 head. After\nmain's merge brought #612's Tormach lathe post, which refuses any\nnon-zero FinishAllowance, five lathe_post_tormach_thread tests went red\n(\"LinuxCNC's G76 has no finish-pass allowance word\"): under #417 the\nfield is the finishing pass's own step. The parent already fixed that\n(548a4ad2, \"the PathPilot G76 reads the finishing step #417 states\"), so\nthe parent's refreshed head is merged here instead of re-deriving the\nfix by hand.\n\n- crates/post/tests/inverted_post.rs: keep this branch's\n  repeat_each_depth beside the parent's fields.\n- crates/post/tests/recorded_streams.rs: one `alternating: false`, after\n  pull_out, beside repeat_each_depth (the parent and 872cc40d both added it).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
